  "cy_00072": {
    "english": "something continuing constantly at every moment",
    "figurativeZh": "现代用法：表示时时刻刻。通常用“无时无刻不……”表达“时时都……”；这里的双重否定不能省去。",
    "figurativeEn": "Modern use: constantly, at every moment. In the usual construction wu shi wu ke bu..., the double negative means always; the final negative bu must not be omitted."
  },
  "cy_00150": {
    "english": "a public setting with many people present",
    "figurativeZh": "现代用法：指有许多人在场的公开场合，常用于“在大庭广众之下……”。",
    "figurativeEn": "Modern use: a public setting with many people present, commonly in the expression zai da ting guang zhong zhi xia, in public or before a crowd."
  },
  "cy_00158": {
    "english": "something proceeding smoothly without obstacles",
